@host = https://localhost:7047

### Public - list events
GET {{host}}/api/events
Accept: application/json

### Public - list venues
GET {{host}}/api/venues
Accept: application/json

### Register organizer (change details before running repeatedly)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizerName": "Test Organizer",
  "email": "organizer@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "0712345678",
  "organizationName": "Kandy Community Group",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

### Login organizer
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organizer@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}
